<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-055-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Figs. 394-400: rhinoceros and allied skulls by coordinate-grid transformation (Osborn) — Code-to-model traceability: 81/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module docstring maps E1-E7 to functions, quotes source passages, names the Lean mirror and claim boundary; function docstrings cite equations where relevant; morphoeval/math_kg_loops pins lean_theorem and code_locus per law. Deduction: KG code_locus entries name the script path without line ranges; Pass 1 statistics are thinner than the equation list." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
